==English==

===Etymology===
From [[Latin]] ''[[piscātor]]'', fisherman, from Latin ''[[piscis]]'', fish.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}
# Of or pertaining to [[fishermen]] or [[fishing]]; [[piscatory]].
# Of or pertaining to [[fish]]; [[piscine]]
